        <span>THIRUMUDIVAKKAM INDUSTRIAL CORRIDOR • GPS: 12.9818° N, 80.0984° E</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Toolroom Facility Location &amp; Logistics Hub</h3>
      <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-600 mt-1 max-w-3xl">
        Strategically located in Chennai's premier tooling corridor with rapid transit to the Outer Ring Road (ORR), container seaports, and air cargo terminals.
      </p>
    </div>
